# 源码默认 LF：防止 Windows checkout（autocrlf）把源码检出为 CRLF，
# 破坏「读取源码做正则断言」的测试（如 composer-layout.test.ts）与 diff 一致性。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF（cmd 解释器对 LF 脚本兼容性差）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
